  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Joint Programme is guided by  Zambia&#x2019;s Sixth National Development Plan SNDP 2011-2015, which recognizes gender as a cross-cutting issue, and in this regard outlines three objectives for the gender sector, namely  to develop gender-responsive policies and legal framework;  to enhance capacity of women to participate in development and to strengthen institutional capacities for</narrative>
